
========================================================================
  THE TWO BASES OF THE STAIRCASE
========================================================================

  n=5 (m=6 tiles):

  BASIS 1 — ROWS (vertex-local):
    Row 0: 3 tiles [(0, 2), (0, 3), (0, 4)]
    Row 1: 2 tiles [(1, 3), (1, 4)]
    Row 2: 1 tiles [(2, 4)]

  BASIS 2 — RANGES (diagonal, 45° rotated):
    Range 2: 3 tiles [(0, 2), (1, 3), (2, 4)]
    Range 3: 2 tiles [(0, 3), (1, 4)]
    Range 4: 1 tiles [(0, 4)]

  CROSS TABLE (row × range):
    r=2  r=3  r=4  
  i=0   ●    ●    ●  
  i=1   ●    ●    ·  
  i=2   ●    ·    ·  

